# lint-links ignore — Sprint 172 C3 (OSS GA dead-link gate).
# Patterns are gitignore-like globs (** wildcards). Empty lines / # comments allowed.
#
# Rationale:
#   - Historical audit / sprint artifacts: read-only, link-rot is acceptable.
#   - Auto-generated exports: regenerated each sprint, links churn.
#   - Deprecated doc trees: scheduled for B3/B4 reorg in Sprint 172 plan.
#   - Internal-only workspace dumps: not user-facing.
# GA-public surface (root README/CLAUDE/DECKENT/DIRECTIVES, docs/guide,
# docs/reference, docs/adr, docs/release, docs/vision, docs/launch,
# .contracts/**) IS scanned and must be link-clean.

# ─── Sprint / audit history (snapshot, never edit) ────────────────────────
.audit/**
.brain/archive/**
.brain/exports/**
.brain/MEMORY.md
.brain/RETRO.md
.brain/PATTERNS.md
.brain/PROJECT-IDENTITY.md
.brain/ERRORS.md
.brain/sprints/**

# ─── Deckent internal workspace (not user-facing OSS surface) ─────────────
.deckent/**

# ─── VitePress build output ───────────────────────────────────────────────
docs/.vitepress/cache/**
docs/.vitepress/dist/**

